meta {
  name: 03_CreateRequestValidation
  seq: 3
}

docs {
  Scenario: Invalid consent requests are refused and nothing is created

    When validTo is in the past, the create fails with a validation error
    When the redirect URL is not a URL, the create fails with a validation error
    When required resource metadata is missing, the create fails with a problem
    When the token has only the read scope, the create is forbidden
    When no token is sent, the create is unauthorized

  Every step sends a fresh request id. None of the requests is stored, so the scenario
  needs no cleanup.
}
